{"id": "clm:4525499d785dc13534daab5876c659a8542f952a51462feb02af9044ab1cf26c", "type": "statement", "text": "An unavailable organization Link button signals ineligibility; its hover tooltip supplies the reason. Each provider procedure allows creation of a new organization when none is available to link. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/aws-self-serve-marketplace.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Linking Atlas orgs to marketplace billing accounts"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/azure-self-serve-marketplace.md", "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/gcp-self-serve-marketplace.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b1b7637db58b4dc6c0fddc192499fe64be6a9b191476d3abf5c60774b74457d8", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9d4c19ca1d329e1f34bae979e1e9fbd9c863f7c544f4df19374adb93aec2ab9c", "ev:e4fd44a2d1f0edaf149e2ac7774b7aaa60d151ad81bdbec46479745b1277ae1b", "ev:eddad90a8f026099915bf3eb054e5c7ae0fe25d48437833e8bd6aa90117b4387"]}
