{"id": "clm:ad563e091943b6d700a0fad4437ad6d1dc32c62da6d9d4f00f267225a2ce5572", "type": "statement", "text": "Cancelling the AWS marketplace subscription unlinks its billing account but leaves Atlas resources and data in place, and resource charges continue; Microsoft separately documents that deleting the Atlas Azure resource stops marketplace billing without deleting the Atlas organization, projects or clusters. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-03)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/aws-self-serve-marketplace.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Linking Atlas orgs to marketplace billing accounts"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/partner-solutions/mongo-db/create-projects-clusters"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b1b7637db58b4dc6c0fddc192499fe64be6a9b191476d3abf5c60774b74457d8", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3992fcbceec3a6e179b307379696cac76101e45185aa85c42387e9a0e1cd31ac", "ev:4b3ea3f89d6a9fbb2165549438b4773223933134b9a918f5cd88f5f5f3e2c68d"]}
