{"id": "clm:a58c0a3e7a43dbccc076a6576ee3f810825361eef4a6599efa8668b08f038323", "type": "statement", "text": "Two historical firsthand reports describe marketplace-to-Atlas handoff problems: a November 2022 GCP user did not receive the registration button after another person enabled the subscription, and an Azure user reported repeated redirects to signup. The GCP forum response directs the user to Atlas support; neither thread establishes a generally applicable technical fix. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/mongodb-atlas-api-on-gcloud-marketplace-not-referring-me-to-the-page-select-an-organization-to-link-to-your-gcp-billing-account/202208", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Linking Atlas orgs to marketplace billing accounts"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.reddit.com/r/mongodb/comments/v36l1v"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b1b7637db58b4dc6c0fddc192499fe64be6a9b191476d3abf5c60774b74457d8", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:664ef312435482340064620ec449b8c7ced09a30ac22f1ccd4a087192a305533", "ev:cd4129e822608800d29fd9f095b8811d972a5425e034322e4045bfbaf01bb633"]}
